<title>USA: Sacramento, Calif., utility bond deal restructured.</title>
<headline>Sacramento, Calif., utility bond deal restructured.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman, Sachs &amp; Co. said Tuesday it restructured Sacramento Municipal Utility District, Calif.'s $241 million bond deal, adjusting coupons lower in the 2012, 2014, and 2015 maturities.</p>
<p>The restructuring follows:  </p>
<p>SACRAMENTO MUNICIPAL UTILITY DISTRICT, CALIFORNIA</p>
<p>RE: $240,570,000*</p>
<p>ELECTRIC REVENUE REFUNDING BONDS, 1997 SERIES L</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD BASED ON THE FOLLOWING.</p>
<p>NOTE THE COUPON CHANGES IN 2012, 2014 &amp; 2015.</p>
<p>THE ACCOUNT WILL BE CLOSED.</p>
<p>    MOODY'S: A3		  S&amp;P: A		    FITCH: A</p>
<p>		 AAA (EXP)		AAA (EXP)	  AAA (EXP)</p>
